{"id":"memorial_101802","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101800","label":"Data · Climate Change Report"},"label":"April 5, XX.","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101801","next":"memorial_101803","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101802_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"I made a speech in front of the local politicians today."},{"id":"memorial_101802_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"When I mentioned the dramatic rise in temperature,"},{"id":"memorial_101802_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"ice calving, and ice field reduction,"},{"id":"memorial_101802_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"one man raised his hand and had the gall to say,"},{"id":"memorial_101802_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"\"Sounds great to me! I prefer warmer weather.\""},{"id":"memorial_101802_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"It took all my willpower not to grab him by the collar and throttle him."},{"id":"memorial_101802_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_02_description","text":"What fools they are! They won't enjoy the warm weather when the ocean rises to their necks!"}]}